  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A block of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>&nbsp;is attached to a string whose other end is attached to the wall. An unknown force <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> is applied so that the string makes an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> with the wall. The tension <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math> is : (Given g <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0053_12745c6ddfe5.png\" style=\"width: 201px; height: 250px;\" /></p>"
  },
